  "notes": [
    {
      "title": "Layout reuse is a checked invariant",
      "body": "`Damage` (layout.rs:19) records changed lines; `plan` (layout.rs:506) re-shapes only those. `layout_reuse_matches_full_layout` in src/shell/tests/layout.rs compares the reuse with a full layout.",
      "severity": "info",
      "path": "src/views/editor/layout.rs"
    },
    {
      "title": "Editor is a 766-line, 83-field struct",
      "body": "src/views/editor/mod.rs holds the text, cursors, undo/redo, find state, format bar state, figure cache, embed cache and hitboxes; every part file is `impl Editor` on the same struct.",
      "severity": "warn",
      "path": "src/views/editor/mod.rs"
    },
    {
      "title": "Embeds recurse into real Editors",
      "body": "`Embeds::row` (views/editor/embed.rs:129) builds a read-only `Editor` per section, bounded by `DEPTH = 3` (embed.rs:19) and a `trail` that flags circular embeds instead of recursing.",
